{
  "name": "bot-avatars-native",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Animated bot avatars for React Native (Skia + Reanimated) \u2014 port of bot-avatars: eighteen glossy 3D shapes with living faces, three states, the plastic material lit per pixel in a runtime shader",
